msgid "polkit is required"
msgstr "polkit erforderlich"

msgid ""
"Shelly's GUI needs <b>polkit</b> installed and running to authorize "
"privileged actions, but it wasn't found on the system bus.\n"
"\n"
"Install and enable it, then retry.\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit/\">seafoam-"
"labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit</a>"
msgstr ""
"Shellys GUI benötigt <b>polkit</b>, um privilegierte Aktionen zu "
"autorisieren. Polkit wurde jedoch nicht im Systembus gefunden.\n"
"\n"
"Installiere und aktiviere es und versuche es erneut.\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Polkit\">wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Polkit</a>"

